Subject: [PATCH] reader: keep reading mode notices inside the reader window
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

用户报告进入章节与旋转时“单页式”系统提示闪至全屏。替换此类Toast为限宽280dp/限高96dp的应用内短提示，保留偏好，2秒消失，onPause/onDestroy清理。Anikku无ReaderActivity，不直接移植；平台异常待真机复验。
